      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## BOXX - Calculator Lead\n1. Add a \"Calculator Leads\" tab to the CRM sheet with these headers (row 1):\n`email, email_marketing_consent, email_consent_at, consent_text, leads_per_month, missed_pct, close_pct, job_value, lost_monthly, lost_yearly, source, page, utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_content, resource, channel, arrived_from_dlv, first_touch, updated_at`\n2. Select your Google Sheets credential on both Sheets nodes.\n3. Activate, then set `NEXT_PUBLIC_CALCULATOR_WEBHOOK_URL` in Vercel to this workflow's production URL (…/webhook/boxx-calculator). The email box on /tools/missed-lead-calculator only appears once that env var is set.\n4. Consent is required: submissions without `email_marketing_consent: true` are rejected and logged."
      }
    }
